@ApiGateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Register via gateway
POST {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tennyson",
  "email": "tennyson@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "9999999999"
}

### Compare via gateway
POST {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/quantity/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantityOne": { "value": 1, "unit": "Feet", "category": "Length" },
  "quantityTwo": { "value": 12, "unit": "Inch", "category": "Length" }
}
